<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Problema com o Pagamento</title>
</head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#f5f5f5;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">
  <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#f5f5f5;padding:40px 0;">
    <tr><td align="center">
      <table width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#ffffff;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;max-width:600px;width:100%;">

        <tr>
          <td style="background:#000000;padding:24px 40px;text-align:center;">
            <img src="https://lpowjerychcsqrtodvoh.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/email-assets/logo.png" alt="Stockzy" width="160" style="display:block;margin:0 auto;max-width:160px;" />
          </td>
        </tr>

        <tr>
          <td style="padding:40px;">
            <div style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:32px;">
              <div style="display:inline-block;background:#fce4e4;border-radius:50px;padding:10px 24px;">
                <p style="margin:0;color:#c62828;font-size:14px;font-weight:bold;">⚠ Pagamento não aprovado</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <p style="color:#333;font-size:16px;margin:0 0 8px 0;">Olá, {{firstName}},</p>
            <p style="color:#333;font-size:16px;margin:0 0 16px 0;">O pagamento do pedido <strong>{{orderNumber}}</strong> não foi aprovado.</p>
            <p style="color:#666;font-size:14px;margin:0 0 32px 0;">Isso pode ter ocorrido por saldo insuficiente, dados incorretos ou limite do cartão. Tente novamente com outro método de pagamento.</p>

            <a href="{{orderUrl}}" style="display:inline-block;background:#000;color:#fff;text-decoration:none;padding:14px 32px;border-radius:4px;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:32px;">Tentar Novamente</a>

            <p style="color:#999;font-size:13px;margin:0;">Precisa de ajuda? Entre em contacto: <a href="mailto:{{supportEmail}}" style="color:#000;">{{supportEmail}}</a></p>
          </td>
        </tr>

        <tr>
          <td style="background:#f9f9f9;padding:24px 40px;text-align:center;border-top:1px solid #eee;">
            <p style="color:#ccc;font-size:11px;margin:0;">Stockzy © {{year}}</p>
          </td>
        </tr>

      </table>
    </td></tr>
  </table>
</body>
</html>
